// Kept by hand (the importer no longer writes this file). The 35 hero types' starting records:
// `NewGame.c:_hero_premade_table` of the original, one row per hero unit in the order of units.ron.
// `picks` abilities are drawn at random for each wizard when the game starts (`Init_Heroes`; a
// `pick_type` of Warrior draws warrior abilities, Mage mage ones, Any both) on top of the fixed
// `abilities`; `casting_skill` and the four innate `spells` (ids in spells.ron) are fixed. The
// `gender` is the gender of the hero's first (fixed) name, for the messages that name it
// (docs/text.md). The ability names are the `HSA_*` flags of the original; `super_` is the doubled version.
